        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Rocky Mountain HN60x-BD 6\" Solid Bronze House Numbers</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWelcome your guest in style with these 6 inch high, easy to see, silicon bronze house numbers by Rocky Mountain Hardware in dark patina finish. Packaged with installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRocky Mountain Hardware silicon bronze numbers are made to last. They are durable enough for office buildings, apartment buildings and homes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Rocky Mountain Address Numbers\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware for surface mounting.</li>\r\n\r\n<li>There are variances in width for specific digits. <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/RMH-HN60-specifications.pdf?v=1718159617\" target=\"new\"><br><b>CLICK HERE to see the specifications of each number (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
